    "Cut the cards in the middle. Partner A takes the left half, Partner B the right.",
    "A builds question 1 from the tiles and asks it: “¿Qué lee tu hermana?” The verb tile is the infinitive: you choose the form and the tense.",
    "B hears the question and puts the verb in the right form: lee (presente), comí (indefinido), ha escrito (pretérito perfecto: haber + participle). Irregular forms must be learnt: ir, fui, ido.",
    "Then B asks question 2 and A answers. Take turns. At the end, check with the answer sheet.",
    "Finally: swap cards and do it all again, faster."
  ],
